    "## SH2-R1 — Billing API / retry record\n\n```text\npage 1: HTTP 200\n\npage 2:\nattempt 1: HTTP 429\nattempt 2: HTTP 429\nattempt 3: HTTP 429\n\nAfter the final 429, reconciliation continued using 37 records from the previous-night local snapshot for page 2.\n```\n\n",
